WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.300
An investor wants to know who runs the money.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.417
Wealth is an imaginary investment manager in London, with four strategies to compare.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:21.150
Each strategy names the people who run it. Follow a name to see what they manage.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:31.817
Every insight names its author, and the legal pages say plainly that the firm is fictional.

00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:40.567
WordPress stores each link on one side, and the theme works out the other.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.983
The tabs work without JavaScript, and every deploy runs the seed again.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.500
Open a strategy and meet the people who run it, at wealth.junaid.guru.
